OL,3,GNEWSATrains at a standstill after
OL,4,Aperson dies on tracks
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services have been suspended on
OL,7,Fthe main west coast train route after a
OL,8,Fperson was found dead at a railway
OL,9,Fstation in Lancashire.
OL,11,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) said
OL,12,Fofficers were called to Leyland railway
OL,13,Fstation just before 07:00 BST on
OL,14,FMonday, following reports of a casualty
OL,15,Fon the tracks. Paramedics also
OL,16,Fattended, with the person pronounced
OL,17,Fdead at the scene.
OL,19,FAvanti West Coast said all lines have
OL,20,Fbeen blocked between Preston and Wigan
OL,21,FNorth Western due to "emergency
OL,22,Fservices managing an incident".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
